        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "82cad93e-5d2b-593b-8135-4d54aae02b12",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: SM Prime Holdings\n- Projects: SM Lifestyle Cities, Mall of Asia Complex\n- Products: SM City Clark, SM City North EDSA, SM Lanang Premier, SM Southmall, SM Seaside City Cebu\n- Places: Pasay City, Angeles City, Pampanga, Davao, Cebu, Clark Freeport, M.A. Roxas Avenue\n\nFacts:\n- SM Lifestyle Cities are integrated mixed-use developments of SM Prime Holdings.\n- SM Prime Holdings plans to develop more lifestyle cities similar to the 60-hectare Mall of Asia Complex in Pasay City to optimize land where premier malls currently stand.\n- SM Prime Holdings has identified SM City Clark in Angeles City, Pampanga, SM City North EDSA, SM Lanang Premier in Davao, SM Southmall, and SM Seaside City Cebu as subsequent lifestyle city sites.\n- SM City Clark is a shopping mall owned and operated by SM Prime Holdings.\n- SM City Clark is located along M.A. Roxas Avenue in Clark Freeport, Angeles City, Pampanga, Philippines.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
